# Git workflow

New work lands via a feature branch and a pull request, not a direct push to `main`.
When the work is verified, push the branch and open a PR. Do not fast-forward local
`main` and push it.

Feature and bugfix work is pstack (`/poteto-mode`), including Opening a PR. Gates
still run. Default review is `/interrogate` + `/no-comments`, plus `/blast-radius`
before the PR. Thermo-nuclear is on-demand.

Do not merge the PR. Hand off after it is open.

Branch names: a descriptive slug (e.g. `feat/<slug>`).

## PR review

Default in-session review is pstack `/interrogate` (and `/no-comments` before the PR).
`/code-review` is user-triggered. Thermo-nuclear is user-triggered.
